{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2600, "text": "Good evening, friends."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 7160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4960, "text": "Spiffy jacket, Dan. You selling real\nestate?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9380, "text": "Oh, ye of little breeding."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 17280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12200, "text": "Behold, the family crest. An English\nhunting falcon grasping a spear."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 21260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18260, "text": "Looks more like Big Bird with an arrow\nthrough his butt."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 26260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23700, "text": "Isn't your family from the Louisiana\nBayou, Dan?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 30800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26720, "text": "That's right. Your family crest should\nbe a possum grasping his cousin."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 40100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37080, "text": "Actually, I bought this at a yuppie\nsurplus store."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 44620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41100, "text": "Why? To become a member of high society."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 46780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44960, "text": "And how does one do that?"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 50780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47460, "text": "By basking in the glow of Manhattan\nmoonlight."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 53380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51300, "text": "You're going to be in the Manhattan\nmoonlight column?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 57040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53680, "text": "Yes. Dermot Drake is coming here tonight\nto interview me."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 60480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57640, "text": "He's only interested in upper crust\npeople, not..."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 61970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60830, "text": "Flaky crust, people."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 65110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63270, "text": "Why would you want to be in that column?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 66810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65810, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 69550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67170, "text": "Drake's column defines New York society."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 73290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69930, "text": "I mean, one mention in it is a\nguaranteed membership in the Eastside"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 77510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73290, "text": "Club. Then, it's weekends in the\nHamptons and just a short walk down the"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 79370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 77510, "text": "with some Buffy Blueblood."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 83170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80510, "text": "In layman's terms, it's my ticket out of\nhere."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 85310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83550, "text": "If it's a one -way ticket, I'll chip in."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 88270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87270, "text": "Ouch."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 93490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92490, "text": "Hey, Lizette."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 97530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96530, "text": "Lizette?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 99510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98510, "text": "Something wrong?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 104350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99850, "text": "Well, last night I had a dream about\nHarry."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 108530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105630, "text": "So? It was a very vivid dream."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 113850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109490, "text": "I was a contessa, and Harry, my stable\nboy."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 121350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114570, "text": "I watched his sinewy body stroke the\nflaxen mane of my favorite steed, and"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 122350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 121350, "text": "then..."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 127280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 126280, "text": "Harry or the horse?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 131540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129840, "text": "Harry? What's that?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 135080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 132440, "text": "Everyone has those kinds of dreams."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 138640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 135960, "text": "So I shouldn't worry about the hay in my\njammies?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 190240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185960, "text": "You know, just because you're filling in\nfor Max doesn't mean you have to dress"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 193920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190240, "text": "like him. I thought it'd help me assume\nan air of authority and confidence."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 197380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194420, "text": "Plus, it has the combination of the\nfiling cabinet cross -stitched on the"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 204040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199360, "text": "Great. And while you're climbing the\nstepladder of success, I gotta fill in"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 207000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204040, "text": "you. And you know I don't like public\nspeaking."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 211640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210640, "text": "All right."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 216020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215020, "text": "Uh..."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 218070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216590, "text": "You know, the judge is here."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 221790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220710, "text": "Sorry, I choked."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 227370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224950, "text": "Hey, Mac has a sweater like that."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 229090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227870, "text": "So has Perry Como."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 230330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229330, "text": "You got a problem?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 233910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232190, "text": "No. Call the first case."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 235230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234230, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 238990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236850, "text": "People versus Nick Strombone."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 242110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239290, "text": "The charge is assault with a deadly\nweapon."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 245470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243390, "text": "Oops. What's the problem, Bull?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 247410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246030, "text": "Hey, Your Honor, it's my first case."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 248630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247630, "text": "Give a guy a chance."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 252330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250730, "text": "A chance and a rake."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 262530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261410, "text": "Sorry, ma 'am."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 266210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263050, "text": "We'll take a five while Bull straightens\nout this mess."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 278390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277390, "text": "Aramis?"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 285450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282230, "text": "What a wonderful surprise."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 288690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286450, "text": "Why the surprise? We had an appointment."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 293130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 290030, "text": "Is that big bird on your chest?"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 295110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293870, "text": "No, it's a possum."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 296790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295690, "text": "Possibly a falcon."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 301410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297050, "text": "By the way, I appreciate your help with\nthis dreadful jury duty business."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 302730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301730, "text": "Tosh, tosh."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 305230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302850, "text": "I know what a hectic social calendar you\nhave."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 310050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308810, "text": "Let's try this one more time."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 311770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310770, "text": "Great. Have a seat."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 313310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311970, "text": "Get a chance to see me in action."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 314770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313650, "text": "I'll take your breath away."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 317550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315830, "text": "People versus Kitty Metger."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 320730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318230, "text": "Prostitution, lewd conduct, and indecent\nexposure."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 324310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323310, "text": "Is this you?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 325950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324490, "text": "Me? No."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 329530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327710, "text": "Take her away."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 333110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331730, "text": "Sorry, sir. It's just collating."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 334830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333330, "text": "I just can't get the hang of it."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 338070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335550, "text": "All right. We'll take another five.\nCounsel."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 342430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338410, "text": "Stay available in case we need to help\nout our clerk -clerk wannabe."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 348750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344470, "text": "Oh, Sir Dermot, is there anything I can\nget you before I resume bringing our"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 350590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348750, "text": "city's bottom feeders to justice?"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 352830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351370, "text": "Some fresh air, perhaps."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 354710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353190, "text": "It's a tad close in here."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 355930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354930, "text": "Oh, certainly."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 356970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355970, "text": "Bill of Russell!"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 363750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358630, "text": "Would you please take my friend for a\nwalk and see that he gets some fresh"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 371500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368140, "text": "Let's go outside and see how many\npigeons we can knock off with that"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 378020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375320, "text": "Read them and weep."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 382760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379940, "text": "One shining light at night court. Oh."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 386100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383180, "text": "Last night I was blah, blah, blah, blah,\nblah, blah, not about me, not about me,"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 390400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386180, "text": "where I met a most arresting,\nintelligent, and witty professional."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 392920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391020, "text": "I can't believe you snowed him."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 394240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393240, "text": "This is so embarrassing."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 395360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394360, "text": "Let's read on."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 399960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396780, "text": "A shining light in our dreary justice\nsystem. Blah, blah, blah, blah, blah,"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 402380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399960, "text": "blah. Justice for all. Blah, blah, blah,\nblah, blah. Here we go."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 406540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402940, "text": "Everyone should be as fortunate as I to\nencounter this officer of the court."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 411060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410060, "text": "Rosalind Russell?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 415180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414180, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 421320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416600, "text": "From behind her bailiff's badge, Miss\nRussell showed me this invisible realm"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 424800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421320, "text": "the city where she handles defendants\nwith firmness and compassion."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 429480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426000, "text": "And... She enlightened me with her pulls\n-no -punches observations."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 433900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429900, "text": "I found Ms. Russell to be a genuine\nbreath of fresh air."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 438740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437440, "text": "What the hell is this?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 442480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439820, "text": "Maybe it's just a really big, really\nlong typo."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 450260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447500, "text": "Hey, Dan, if you're not going to use\nthese, can I have them?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 453780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451160, "text": "Help yourself, Ms. Suddenly Someone."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 460050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458030, "text": "I didn't get a mention, but don't be mad\nat me."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 463810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460590, "text": "One second in the limelight, and look\nwhat you've turned into."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 466710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464470, "text": "A megla medium mooch."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 469670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467970, "text": "Hey, what is wrong with you?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 475670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470930, "text": "Because of your spotlight stealing, I am\nout of the athletic club, and I've"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 479530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475670, "text": "kissed off Buffy Blueblood and the\nFrench maid I was going to hire."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 482370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480130, "text": "I didn't steal anything from you."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 485430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482650, "text": "Dermot didn't interview me. We only made\nsmall talk."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 486870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485870, "text": "Small talk."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 488040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487000, "text": "Well, here's a small word."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 490200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489200, "text": "Betrayal."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 495740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491040, "text": "Wait a minute. I went along with your\nlittle act. So don't make my moment in"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 497640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495740, "text": "sun your darkest hour."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 503520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500240, "text": "Hey, Miss Debutante, the Hamptons are\nthe other way."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 514380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511360, "text": "Lizette, why are you sitting over here?"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 516669, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514909, "text": "Are you still worried about Harry in\nyour dream?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 521669, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517070, "text": "I'm trying to put some lust -free\ndistance between me and the Knight"}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 526009, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525170, "text": "What's that?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 529870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526010, "text": "This is silly. All Harry did in your\ndream was kiss you."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 531090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530090, "text": "That was before."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 535750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531450, "text": "Remember how I dreamt I was a Contessa\nand Harry my sinewy stable boy?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 540890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536750, "text": "Well, last night, we had to escape from\nthe evil Count. In the passion of"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 543570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540890, "text": "danger, we ripped off all our clothes\nand rode bareback."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 545620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544520, "text": "to Paris, France."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 554920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548400, "text": "After we had our sores treated, he\ncarried me up a staircase"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 559320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554920, "text": "into a Winnebago where it happened."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 560880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559880, "text": "Time out."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 562700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561360, "text": "A Winnebago?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 566360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562920, "text": "You know dreams. I went to an RV show\nlast week."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 570720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569140, "text": "So what happened?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 572940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571500, "text": "It happened."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 577840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575080, "text": "It? Oh, you mean you did it."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 579320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578320, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 581100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579620, "text": "And the worst part is?"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 584400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581640, "text": "We lived happily ever after."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 588820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587020, "text": "Winnebago's are very roomy, you know."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 593900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590920, "text": "There's nothing abnormal about having\nromantic dreams."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 599120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594380, "text": "No, you don't understand. I know this is\nmy subconscious telling me to leave my"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 601780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599120, "text": "boyfriend Oscar, the tyrannical evil\ncount,"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 605300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604280, "text": "Tender stable boy."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 611440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607460, "text": "You are obviously upset about this. You\nhave to talk directly to Harry and deal"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 612119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611440, "text": "with it."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 613960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612120, "text": "Well, okay."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 617300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 614600, "text": "But I'll just melt if he smells like\nsaddle soap."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 620320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619320, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 622840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620540, "text": "Criminal court part two is now in\nsession."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 627040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623580, "text": "Hey, you in the back, button it. The\nHonorable Harold T. Stone is here."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 639010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637870, "text": "Everything in order, boo?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 640290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639290, "text": "Hip -hopter."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 644810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642710, "text": "People versus Margaret Kalekstein."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 646230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645230, "text": "Shoplifting."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 648850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647850, "text": "Are you Margaret?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 650910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649910, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 652550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651550, "text": "Kalekstein?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 654750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653750, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 657570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656570, "text": "Take her away."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 664350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660770, "text": "Reading a docket while wearing a sweater\nisn't as easy as it seems, sir."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 667970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665570, "text": "Obviously, it's right up there with...\nquantum physics."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 673330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669050, "text": "Apparently Mac is some brilliant\nscientist who's been moonlighting from"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 674650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673330, "text": "to keep our files straight."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 680310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677830, "text": "We will take yet another five."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 685470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683810, "text": "Excuse me, Miss Russell."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 686930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685830, "text": "Oh, Dermot!"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 688990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687570, "text": "I take it you got my messages?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 694010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689590, "text": "Regrettably. And the humidor of those\nwhite owl cigars you sent."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 696210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694770, "text": "I gave them to my doorman."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 698660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697660, "text": "Ross."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 704640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699100, "text": "I'm so sorry to disturb you, but my\nfriend insisted on meeting my newest"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 710660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704640, "text": "star. Hello, darling. I'm Gloria\nVanderhorst. May I call you darling?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 712820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 711380, "text": "You can call me Ross."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 717880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713440, "text": "Darling, I'm an impeccable judge of\ncharacter, and I can tell by looking at"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 719200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717880, "text": "that you have character."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 723720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720180, "text": "And I can tell by looking at you that\nyou are a character."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 732420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730800, "text": "I've just had a fabulous idea."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 736500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732920, "text": "Tonight is a regular soiree aboard my\nlate fourth husband's yacht."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 738680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736820, "text": "Your late fifth husband's yacht."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 741440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739100, "text": "Oh, fifth. One of those darlings."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 746160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742560, "text": "Anyway, Roz, we'd love for you to join\nus."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 749300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747420, "text": "Well, I don't know."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 752560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749820, "text": "A yacht. Fabulous. When do we cast off?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 755000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753580, "text": "You can cast off now."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 760990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758030, "text": "We'll be leaving from the 23rd Street\nPier at 10 sharp."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 762910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761290, "text": "See you tonight, darling."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 770550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767590, "text": "Get a load of that. I mean, like they\nreally think you want to go to their"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 771550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770550, "text": "party."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 773170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772170, "text": "I do."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 775370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774370, "text": "Darling."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 785150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781510, "text": "Here it is, sir."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 788360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785790, "text": "I finally figured out the flaw in my...\ncollating system."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 791180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789580, "text": "Don't get my hopes up, Bull."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 797100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793200, "text": "I want to prove to you that Bull Shannon\nhas the right stuff, the right file,"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 799160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797320, "text": "the right name, the right defendant."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 803760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801860, "text": "People versus Margaret Keene."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 808700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806520, "text": "Are you Margaret Keene?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 828850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825230, "text": "Before we begin, I want to apologize for\nall the confusion. You've been very"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 833650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828850, "text": "patient with us. Now we're going to\nexpedite matters and get you on your"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 834589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833650, "text": "promise you."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 835910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834590, "text": "Thank you, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 837150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836150, "text": "My pleasure."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 838550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837170, "text": "Bull, what's the charge?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 840630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839630, "text": "Manslaughter."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 843070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842070, "text": "Bull!"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 845090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843530, "text": "But it is manslaughter, sir."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 848650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845990, "text": "Your Honor, it was bingo night at St."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 850010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849010, "text": "Genevieve's."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 853930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850690, "text": "The defendant attacked the bingo caller\nfor calling..."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 855190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854190, "text": "B -89."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 857390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855470, "text": "That's B -89."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 865810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859310, "text": "Yeah. The stinking game was rigged.\nThere's no B -89 spot on a bingo card."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 867390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866170, "text": "So I offed him."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 875110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870270, "text": "Well, on that lovely note, let's hold\nthis one over for trial."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 879350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876890, "text": "Amber? Yes, sir? You're fired."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 886740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882960, "text": "I've got a boat to catch. Roz, before\nyou go, there's something I've got to"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 890600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887380, "text": "Look, Dan, you know this is not my\nfault. Those people just happened to"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 891600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890600, "text": "me. I know."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 894160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892780, "text": "And I'm happy for you."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 895720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894720, "text": "Really."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 897320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896000, "text": "And you can't go with me?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 898820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897820, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 904780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899160, "text": "What I'm trying to say is that our\nfriendship is more important than any"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 908100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904780, "text": "old glamorous party on a fabulous yacht."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 910300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909300, "text": "Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 915680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910800, "text": "Absolutely. I am at peace with this. I\nguess I can't have everything, or in"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 916680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915680, "text": "case, anything."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 920560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917120, "text": "But I don't want you to feel guilty\nabout it."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 923120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921640, "text": "Okay, I won't."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 924480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923480, "text": "Bon voyage!"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 929940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928940, "text": "There."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 933100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930400, "text": "I have done a thoroughly selfless thing."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 937160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934980, "text": "And now I'm going to be sick to my\nstomach."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 944869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943950, "text": "Do you have a minute?"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 946130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944870, "text": "Sure. What's on your mind, Lizette?"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 948790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946910, "text": "What side of the bed do you sleep on?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 952630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950070, "text": "It doesn't matter. I'll sleep on either\nside."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 957510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953390, "text": "But I do snore. A little. And sometimes\nI talk in the voices of cartoon"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 958510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957510, "text": "characters."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 962250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960510, "text": "Lizette, what the hell are you talking\nabout?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 966450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963250, "text": "The stable and the floor of that\nWinnebago."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 979940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978800, "text": "I'll have to quit my job."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 981260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980260, "text": "Conflict of interest."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 984620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981520, "text": "But maybe we could still save up for a\nhouse in the country."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 991680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985420, "text": "You know, Lizette, whatever it is you're\ntalking about, why don't you just leave"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 992559, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991680, "text": "me out of it?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 994180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992560, "text": "Oh, I see."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 996060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994580, "text": "It's all clear to me now."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 997960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996540, "text": "Steal me from the count."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1000080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998300, "text": "Whisk me off to Paris, France."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1001620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000340, "text": "Have your way with me."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1007100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002120, "text": "Then you expect me to disappear like one\nof those lame magic tricks you..."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1048230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043010, "text": "This has been the most amazing night of\nmy life."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1051350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1049090, "text": "Never been on a yacht before."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1054630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053110, "text": "Champagne was flowing."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1057210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055550, "text": "Music was playing."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1060170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057830, "text": "I even danced with Rex Reed."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1064970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062170, "text": "Sip my cordial by the rail and..."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1068160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065340, "text": "Watched a blanket of fog cover the\nlights of Manhattan."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1070820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069600, "text": "So beautiful."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1073860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072280, "text": "So serene."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1080180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076100, "text": "Until I heard the sound of a jet ski\ncutting through the water."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1087700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082480, "text": "And caught a glimpse of a man in evening\nwear bearing down directly on us."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1091640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089640, "text": "And then that awful thud."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1098200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093140, "text": "And the next thing I know, The yacht's\nat the bottom of the river, and I'm"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1099640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098200, "text": "in this lousy lifeboat."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1104740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102060, "text": "Those jet skis are awfully hard to\ncontrol."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1111820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109380, "text": "You sunk the damn yacht, Dan."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1115420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112220, "text": "Shh, not so loud. Remember, I'm not on\nthe guest list."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1120680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115860, "text": "How could you do this? What on earth\npossesses a man to crash a party in the"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1121840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120680, "text": "middle of the Hudson River?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1124260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123260, "text": "Zeal?"}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1126030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124770, "text": "I'll seal you."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1131830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126770, "text": "Roz, you have no idea how it killed me\nnot being in that newspaper."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1136550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132770, "text": "You know, I try to hide my\ndisappointment, but I can't help it."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1138530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136870, "text": "I am what I am."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1141350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140350, "text": "Fielding!"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1143150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141670, "text": "What are you doing here?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1145530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143390, "text": "I know for a fact you weren't invited."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1148470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147470, "text": "Wrong."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1150410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149410, "text": "He's my guest."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1152130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150930, "text": "I invited him."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1153299, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152480, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1154300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153300, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1157400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156400, "text": "Yes, she did."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1160220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158220, "text": "Then why haven't I seen you all night?"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1162380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160500, "text": "I was overboard."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1169640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163220, "text": "Overboard? Well, I was hanging\noverboard. The escargot sort of"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1172300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171200, "text": "Oh, darling."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1175220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172780, "text": "Did the escargot taste odd to you, too?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1180420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175820, "text": "I do recall Klaus mentioning something\nabout the escargot being a bit pasty."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1194130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193070, "text": "Because I'm your friend."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1197430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195290, "text": "And it's not nice to let your friends\ndown."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1199950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198450, "text": "Let that be a lesson to you."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1201930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200930, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1206270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202230, "text": "I mean, if you want to drown yourself\ntrying to use these people, that's fine."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1208770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207130, "text": "But you tried to use me, too."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1212830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211830, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1216470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213990, "text": "I'm a victim of myself. What can I say?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1219950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218850, "text": "But I promise you this."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1222270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220310, "text": "From now on, I'm a different guy."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1225300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224040, "text": "So don't be mad at me, please."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1229760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226320, "text": "If I were mad at you, would I have\npulled your drowning butt out of the"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1233120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232120, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1235140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234120, "text": "It's all right."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1237460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235660, "text": "In a way, you saved me, too."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1241140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237960, "text": "I was actually beginning to enjoy these\npeople."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1247740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242200, "text": "Darling, did I hear you say someone\nsaved you?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1249880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248120, "text": "I was talking about Dan."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1252100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250740, "text": "How utterly heroic."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1254940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253000, "text": "Dermot, you must hear this."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1258620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255340, "text": "That darling rescued this darling from\ndrowning."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1260960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259080, "text": "Oh, no, no, not exactly rescue."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1262560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261260, "text": "How fascinating."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1267520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263280, "text": "Get to tell, Sylving, this could be a\ncompelling story for my column."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1273200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272200, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1274720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273720, "text": "Absolutely."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1278220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276040, "text": "Well, Roz..."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1281680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278460, "text": "was standing by the reeling. When the\nexplosion happened, she was thrown"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1286560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281680, "text": "overboard. Well, naturally, I\nimmediately dived into the icy water and"}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1291500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286560, "text": "her semi -conscious body to the safety\nof this lifeboat. I gave her mouth -to"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1295140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291500, "text": "-mouth resuscitation and pulled her from\nDavy Jones' locker."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1296960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295960, "text": "Right, Roz?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1298840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297840, "text": "Wrong."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1300800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299380, "text": "Darling. No!"}
